  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B4D-SIWI Chemical Management India 2013-14</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B4D-SIWI Chemical Management India 2013-14</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIWI collaborates with KappAhl, Lindex and Indiska in order to reduce the use of water and chemical discharges in the indian textile and    leather industry. The objective of the projedct is to implement       Swedish Textile Water Ininitiative guidelines for sustainable water   and chemical management in 39 textile factories and industries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SIWI samarbetar med KappAhl, Lindex och Indiska f&#xf6;r att minska        vatten- och kemikalienav&#xe4;ndningen i textilindustrin i Indien. Syftet  &#xe4;r att implementera Swedish Textile Water Initiative&apos;s riktlinjer f&#xf6;r h&#xe5;llbar vattenanv&#xe4;ndning i textilindustrin hos 39 textil-producenter.</narrative>
  </description>
